{
  "id": "ask-stove",
  "name": "食材管家",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "把「冰箱里有啥、今晚吃啥、周末买啥」变成可对话的资产：食材库存五分区+临期红榜（过期即红、剩 N 天即黄，一键记吃掉/扔掉）、菜谱库（URL 一键导入——后台服务原生 fetch 根治浏览器跨域并带 SSRF 守卫，也可手动或让 AI 从正文抽取）、本周计划、采购清单（按未来 7 天计划缺料自动扣在库补齐，按超市动线六类分组）、浪费透视（吃掉 vs 扔掉、浪费率、12 周趋势）。灶签推荐引擎完全可解释：临期食材加分、缺料降权、近 7 天做过的回避，每条推荐带理由。AI 经 12 个 stove_* MCP 工具口语化管理——「买了两斤排骨一把小葱」入库、「番茄用掉了」消耗、「今晚 20 分钟能做啥」带理由推荐。数据全走 cap.kv，桌面/手机同源；采购清单在手机上边逛边勾。",
  "enabledByDefault": true,
  "contributes": {
    "views": [
      {
        "id": "ask-stove.panel",
        "area": "activityBar",
        "panelType": "askStove",
        "icon": "Beaker",
        "labelKey": "plugins.askStove",
        "labelDefault": "食材管家",
        "order": 83
      }
    ],
    "panel": {
      "entry": "./dist/panel.js",
      "supportsFullscreen": true
    },
    "services": [
      {
        "id": "stove-service",
        "type": "http",
        "command": "node",
        "argsTemplate": [
          "{{pluginDir}}/service/stove.js",
          "{{port}}",
          "{{appConfigDir}}"
        ],
        "healthCheck": "/__health",
        "healthCheckTimeout": 5000,
        "autoStart": true,
        "restartOnFailure": true,
        "maxRestarts": 10,
        "description": "菜谱 URL 抓取执行器（唯一外联点，SSRF 守卫）+ 命令邮箱消费 + 孤儿结果清扫"
      }
    ],
    "mcpServers": [
      {
        "id": "ask-stove",
        "transport": "stdio",
        "command": "node",
        "argsTemplate": [
          "{{pluginDir}}/mcp/server.js",
          "{{appConfigDir}}"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "permissions": {
    "network": true,
    "aiToolAccess": true
  },
  "origin": {
    "repository": "https://github.com/misxzaiz/Polaris-plugin",
    "homepage": "https://github.com/misxzaiz/Polaris-plugin/tree/main/plugins/ask-stove",
    "updateUrl": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/misxzaiz/Polaris-plugin@main/plugins/ask-stove/update.json",
    "downloadUrl": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/misxzaiz/Polaris-plugin@main/plugins/ask-stove/ask-stove.zip"
  }
}
